<Episode>
<Section type="report" startTime="0" endTime="808.248">
<Turn startTime="0" endTime="5.782" speaker="spk1">
<Sync time="0"/>
*Bueno** pos na:nah ekintsi:n tehwa:tsi:n kwali 'te:chtapowi:s ke:ní:w ne:n wehka:w tapa:tskayah
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="5.782" endTime="142.499">
<Sync time="5.782"/>
Mm, *es que** tiktekiah owat,
<Sync time="9.532"/>
wa:n tiksakayah, 'te:mah ka:mpa *trapiche**
<Sync time="13.578"/>
wa:n mo:stika kwalka:n, se: o:rah de tane:si tikwitih kwa:koweh ixta:wat wa:n tikwa:ilpiah ya
<Sync time="22.469"/>
wa:n ke:mah tikta:liliah *yubo** wa:n kowyu:ntas** tikwa:ilpiah.
<Sync time="28.266"/>
Wa:n ke:mah ti..., tikwa:ilpiah wa:n tikilpiah itech *espeque** wa:n mota:liah o:me:n trapi:chehtsi:ntan wa:n 
<Sync time="38.025"/>
tikalakiah owat, se: nika:n, se: nepa mowa:lkepa ihkó:n.
<Sync time="43.828"/>
Entó:s pe:wa 'tapa:tskah ya, lo..., *seguro** de tane:si 'mattok de tono:ras, se: o:rah de tane:si,
<Sync time="53.625"/>
ke:mah tapa:tsaka ya, tipe:wah ya.
<Sync time="58.765"/>
Entó:s ne:pa tikitah ox tahko ahsi a *caso**,
<Sync time="65.624"/>
kitaxo:taltiliah ya para mah molo:ni a.
<Sync time="70.639"/>
Ke:mah tepitsi:n tamolo:ni wa:n kipahyo:tiah ya, kownex tikpa:tayah wa:n 
<Sync time="77.531"/>
mi:xte:ka wa:n t'te:kiliah ya para mochi:wa ya kwali *panela**.
<Sync time="82.733"/>
Ke:mah kitatokiliah, kimanah, kimanah *hasta** tsokowa:ki, *hasta** mochi:wa nekti,
<Sync time="90.264"/>
ke:mah pe:wa nejó:n mochi:wa *panela** ya.
<Sync time="96.249"/>
Chochopoka ya, tachochopoka, mochi:wa *panela** ya. De *panela** mochi:wa,
<Sync time="103.108"/>
se: kima:nelowa ya ika se: kowit, tikiliah tehwa:n tahmolo,
<Sync time="108.217"/>
entó:s t'ma:nelowah, t'ma:nelowah *hasta** kitiliah ya kwali *punto** moka:wa ya, ki:xtiah ya.
<Sync time="115.983"/>
Ke:mah kinelowah, kinelowah wehka:wa,
<Sync time="120.39"/>
*hasta** kwali kitah ke: kwali a para kite:te:kaskeh ika *moldes**, se: kite:te:ka ya,
<Sync time="128.343"/>
ke:mah se: kite:te:ka, ne:pa se: kitekpa:na ya, mah se:wi a
<Sync time="134.687"/>
para okyowatika se: kihki:xtia, se: kipihpi:ki a, ke:mah.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1 spk2" startTime="142.499" endTime="149.124">
<Sync time="142.499"/>
<Who nb="1"/>
Wa:n itech i:n tekit te:wa:ntiah *este** nochi ta:kameh *o** no: tapale:wia yah siwa:meh.
<Who nb="2"/>
No kwaltia tisiwa:meh.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="149.124" endTime="168.561">
<Sync time="149.124"/>
kwaltia tisiwa:meh, se: mota:lia trapi:chehtsi:ntan, se: kalakia owat wa:n ne:paka se: wa:n se: mopale:wia.
<Sync time="158.086"/>
Wa:n se: tamana, se: kitatokilia *caso** no: se: kwaltia se: siwa:meh,
<Sync time="162.92"/>
ke:mah *por eso** se: kimati ke:ní:w se: kichi:wa, mm.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="168.561" endTime="170.842">
<Sync time="168.561"/>
Wa:n ta:kameh toni kichi:wayah.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="170.842" endTime="205.388">
<Sync time="170.842"/>
Pos tamanah ya no:, te:pale:wiah ya no:, tamanah yehwa:n takalakiah seki ika n' owat,
<Sync time="178.342"/>
seki komo a:mo teyi, a:mo ahsi nochi ta:kameh, se: kowsaka para manis ne:n *panela**,
<Sync time="184.857"/>
pos se:, tapale:wiah siwa:meh ya, mm wa:n ne:n, nejó:n seki sepa owatekih.
<Sync time="195.741"/>
Pos ika yo:n timosempale:wiah ya, ke:mah pero yo:n chi:walis semi *fuerte**, mm.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="205.388" endTime="209.061">
<Sync time="205.388"/>
Ke:meh ka:nachi tokni:wan tapale:wiah para tapa:tskah.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="209.061" endTime="247.748">
<Sync time="209.061"/>
Pos se: mosempale:wia, se: miakeh, se: o:men sah a:mo se: weli, mm.
<Sync time="214.271"/>
O:men ta..., nimitsilihtok, se: nika:n takalakia, se: ne:paka mowa:lkepa, ke:meh yo:n tietok,
<Sync time="220.33"/>
ompa 'kalakia n' owat seko, *es que trapiche** e:yi, ihkó:n, ihkó:n. 
<Sync time="227.248"/>
Tatahko yetok te:na:n tikilia:yah,
<Sync time="231.123"/>
ni:nipaka tanakastan tein pilimeh, entó:s nika:n se: ihkó:n kikalakia n' owat, se: nika:n, mm.
<Sync time="240.563"/>
Entó:s mochi:wa ya nekkwa:t wa:n se: tapa:tska ya.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1 spk2" startTime="247.748" endTime="255.232">
<Sync time="247.748"/>
<Who nb="1"/>
Tikihtowa nankipahyo:tia:yah, ke:ní:w nankimatiah.
<Who nb="2"/>
Ke:mah, tikpahyo:tia:yah ika kownex.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="255.232" endTime="269.857">
<Sync time="255.232"/>
Ke:mah para kwahkwali *panela** ki:sa, kownex se: kipa:ta wa:n 
<Sync time="260.107"/>
se:.... Mi:xte:ka se: kichia, se: kite:kilia sakie:ra o:me *viaje** 
<Sync time="264.591"/>
para yehwa yo:n ye:kkwahkwali *panela** kinamakah, mm.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="269.857" endTime="275.273">
<Sync time="269.857"/>
Wa:n tikihtowah no: kima:nelowa:yah, koma:mo se: kima:neloh.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="275.273" endTime="286.044">
<Sync time="275.273"/>
Ka:n kwaltia, tata, ke:mah tata. Entó:s se: kima:nelowa, de pe:wa chochopoka ya pe:wa ya se: kima:nelohtiowih ya.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1 spk2" startTime="286.044" endTime="300.247">
<Sync time="286.044"/>
<Who nb="1"/>
No tikihtowa:ya i..., ihwa:k *este** mo:stika kikihki:xtiah ya ne:.
<Who nb="2"/>
Ke:mah. Mo:stika kwalka:n se: kihki:xtia itech *moldes**, se: tapihpi:ki a, ke:mah.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="300.247" endTime="304.465">
<Sync time="300.247"/>
kwali 'te:chtapowi:s ke:ní:w se: tapihpi:ki.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="304.465" endTime="323.653">
<Sync time="304.465"/>
Pos ika to:tomo:ch se: tapihpi:ki oso ika owasakat.
<Sync time="309.458"/>
No: weli ika owasakat se: kita:ta:lia, se: ke:kelpachowilia *panela**, o:me se: ki:xna:miktia
<Sync time="316.356"/>
wa:n se: tapihpi:ki a, se: kihilpia ika xo:no:t, ke:mah.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="323.653" endTime="329.091">
<Sync time="323.653"/>
Tehwa:tsi:n *este** tikmattok ke:ní:w se: kito:ka ne:n owat.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="329.091" endTime="353.966">
<Sync time="329.091"/>
Ke:mah. Owat ikechtayo, ke:mah se: kito:ka oho:me.
<Sync time="335.091"/>
Ne: ke:man t'to:kayah sayoh ika kowitso:k, a:mo ke:meh a:man kichi:wah, nochi *hoyos**, e:mah
<Sync time="341.493"/>
tiktachkwiliah wa:n tikto:kah oho:me owat, ni:nipaka ihkó:n momaxalowa.
<Sync time="346.79"/>
Wa:n yehwa ya yo:n selia ya, mochi:wa ya owakone:meh, mm.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="353.966" endTime="359.091">
<Sync time="353.966"/>
Ka:nachi xiwit wehka:wa se: kito:ka owat wa:n para se: kiteki kwali.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="359.091" endTime="363.669">
<Sync time="359.091"/>
Se: xiwit wehweia, mm.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1 spk2" startTime="363.669" endTime="369.689">
<Sync time="363.669"/>
<Who nb="1"/>
Ke:ní:w se: ki:xmati n' owat ika kwaltias a para se: kipa:tskas.
<Who nb="2"/>
Tein xo:chiowa.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="369.689" endTime="379.596">
<Sync time="369.689"/>

Tein xo:chiowa ya, chika:wak a, mm.
<Sync time="373.258"/>
Tein pilimeh ok, pos aya:mo xo:chiowa, selik ok.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="379.596" endTime="384.425">
<Sync time="379.596"/>
Yo:n ihwa:k kinamakayah sayoh *panela o** no: 'kowayah nekkwa:t.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="384.425" endTime="404.306">
<Sync time="384.425"/>
No:, no: te:kowilia:yah wa:n nekti no: kikowah wa:n *panela** tiknamakayah,
<Sync time="391.677"/>
katka *barato**, katka nahna:wi tomi:n.
<Sync time="396.833"/>
Mm, a..., ka:sá: ika *a veinticinco** se:hse: tomi:n kilia:yah, mm.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="404.306" endTime="407.768">
<Sync time="404.306"/>
Yo:n nekkwa:t toni kichi:wilia:yah tein 'kowayah.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="407.768" endTime="422.455">
<Sync time="407.768"/>
Pos tayih, tayih, ke:mah, taya:yah tokni:wa:n.
<Sync time="413.434"/>
A:kin a:mo kichi:wa pos wi:tsa 'kowaki ka:mpa kimantokeh *o** nekti kikowakih, mm.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="422.455" endTime="425.356">
<Sync time="422.455"/>
Wa:n nekti ton, ton kikwiah.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="425.356" endTime="436.769">
<Sync time="425.356"/>
Nekti pos yehwa yo:n se: kikwa ika witsti ata, *hasta** a:man, mm,
<Sync time="430.884"/>
yehwa yo:n se: kikwa, para witsti se: kimana, ika se: kikwa ya sepa.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="436.769" endTime="442.512">
<Sync time="436.769"/>
Wa:n no: moka:wa ya ne:n ipachio n' owat.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="442.512" endTime="457.552">
<Sync time="442.512"/>
Ke:mah, ne: kasa:cheh tikilia:yah,
<Sync time="445.483"/>
ke:mah yeh nejó:n tikmimilohtiowih ya.
<Sync time="448.783"/>
Ke:mah, tiki:xtiliah i:xko wa:n t'mimilohtiowih,
<Sync time="452.568"/>
mm, tikchipa:wah, para chipa:wak ki:sa ya n' *panela**.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="457.552" endTime="460.244">
<Sync time="457.552"/>
Wa:n yo:n ika toni se: kiki:xtilia.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="460.244" endTime="480.646">
<Sync time="460.244"/>
Ika *mismo** ixi:wah tein ika se: taxi:wahwia, mm, ke:mah,
<Sync time="467.524"/>
se: kichi:wa ya *más**, koma:mo se: kipia de yo:n tepos, a:man a..., wehka:w a:mo teh teposmeh katka.
<Sync time="474.469"/>
Tikwiah de xi:kalmeh, tikohkoyo:niah wa:n yeh tikwiah, mm.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="480.646" endTime="483.38">
<Sync time="480.646"/>
Ika toni se: 'kohkoyo:nia:ya.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="483.38" endTime="504.283">
<Sync time="483.38"/>
Xi:kal, se: xi:kaltsi:n ihko:ntsi:n, se: 'kohkoyo:nia itsi:ntan 
<Sync time="489.162"/>
wa:n ke:mah para se: ta:taxi:wahwia ya, kihilpia ika kowit, kemetstiah.
<Sync time="494.922"/>
Ke:mah se: taxi:xi:wahwia ya para de po:poso:ni nekkwa:t para a:mo mimilowi, mm.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="504.283" endTime="506.848">
<Sync time="504.283"/>
¿Wa:n owapach toni kichi:wilia:yah?
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="506.848" endTime="517.293">
<Sync time="506.848"/>
Owapach se: kikwi a para se: ikochpet katka tikinchi:wayah kochpetameh, tankwa:pechmeh
<Sync time="513.159"/>
wa:n seki para tataya, ika tamanah ya, mm.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="517.293" endTime="519.358">
<Sync time="517.293"/>
Ke:niwki yo:n tankwa:pech.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="519.358" endTime="536.638">
<Sync time="519.358"/>
Yo:n se: kwi:pa:na achichi i:n *mesita**
<Sync time="523.031"/>
ke:mah se: kiniwi:pa:naya
<Sync time="526.412"/>
wa:n kochpetat se: kichi:wa we:i ke:meh i:n *mesa** etok.
<Sync time="531.214"/>
Yehwa ne: ke:man katka n' tapechmeh para kochih.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="536.638" endTime="539.584">
<Sync time="536.638"/>
Tehwa:tsi:n xa: tiweli t'chihchi:wa ne:n kochpetat.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="539.584" endTime="544.202">
<Sync time="539.584"/>
Neh niweli, niweli wa:n niweli tankwa:pech nikchi:wa.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="544.202" endTime="547.285">
<Sync time="544.202"/>
kwali 'te:chtapowi:s ke:ní:w se: kichi:wa yo:n.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="547.285" endTime="554.667">
<Sync time="547.285"/>
Se: ki..., se: kilpihtiw ika xo:no:t, se: kwi:pa:na, mm.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="554.667" endTime="558.665">
<Sync time="554.667"/>
Yo:n tankwa:pech toni ne:n kikwiah.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="558.665" endTime="579.058">
<Sync time="558.665"/>
Yo:n itech, de ta:lpan se: tisiah,
<Sync time="561.192"/>
wa:n se: motankwa:pechtia, ne: ke:man nochi ta:lpan 'tisiah, a:mo ahko.
<Sync time="566.738"/>
Ta:lpan timotahtankwa:ke:tsah, titahtapaya:nah ya, ke:mah.
<Sync time="571.764"/>
Ne: ke:man a:mo onkaya tonika se: kwe:chos nextamal, *solo** metat.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="579.058" endTime="598.067">
<Sync time="579.058"/>
*Bueno** pos a:man 'te:chtapowih ya nochi ke:ní:w ne: se: ki..., se: kichi:wa i:n *panela** 
<Sync time="589.225"/>
ke:ní:w tapa:tskah, xa: wel 'te:chtapowi:s se: to:nal tein ke:man, 
<Sync time="592.911"/>
teh *este** tipano:k ne: wehka:w, ke:ní:w ne, ton o:rah name:wayah wa:n nochi tein tikchi:waya.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="598.067" endTime="621.914">
<Sync time="598.067"/>
Pos wehka:w time:wayah kwalka:n,
<Sync time="600.46"/>
de 'tapa:tskayah time:wayah de, nejó:n nimitsilihtok se: o:rah se tane:si,
<Sync time="606.78"/>
a:man ke:ní:w nankiliah se: o:rah de tane:si, ehe,
<Sync time="612.641"/>
para titapa:tskah o:rah. Ke:masá: tikchi:wayah o:me *paila**,
<Sync time="618.122"/>
entó:s pos kwalka:n time:wah.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1 spk2" startTime="621.914" endTime="630.827">
<Sync time="621.914"/>
<Who nb="1"/>
kwali 'te:chtapowi:s a:koni iwa:n 'tapa:tskaya wa:n ke:ní:w nochi nankichi:wayah.
<Who nb="2"/>
No:pa:wa:n wa:n nokni:wa:n, ke:mah.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="630.827" endTime="638.027">
<Sync time="630.827"/>

No:pa:wa:n wa:n nokni:wa:n iwa:n 'tapa:tskayah, mm.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="638.027" endTime="640.69">
<Sync time="638.027"/>

Ke:meh itech katí:n *tiempo** nantapa:tskayah.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="640.69" endTime="682.666">
<Sync time="640.69"/>
Wehka:w a. Ke:meh, s..., nitsikitsi:n katka.
<Sync time="649.279"/>
I:pa pe:wak ni..., nitamati i:pa nejó:n tapa:tskah,
<Sync time="654.738"/>
ke:mah de pe:wak nitamattiw, nikpiaya *tres años, cuatro, cinco**, se: tamattiw a, ke:mah, 
<Sync time="663.662"/>
se: chikwase:n xiwit se: pili tamattok a.
<Sync time="669.252"/>
Ke:mah, entó:s nejó:n kitstokka toni kichi:wah,
<Sync time="673.755"/>
se: tapale:wia ya komo se: te:nawatiah, no: se: kichi:wa ya, sikie:ra kwa:kweh se: kipe:wa, ke:mah.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="682.666" endTime="688.63">
<Sync time="682.666"/>
Tehwa:tsi:n ihwa:k tipili katka, toni semi 'tapale:wia:ya.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="688.63" endTime="700.819">
<Sync time="688.63"/>
Nitape:waya wa:n niowapachsakaya.
<Sync time="691.669"/>
Ke:mah, niowasaka ma:ski ka:n ma:kwi:l owat ne:chilpili:ti:h wa:n no: ne:chma:maltiah, ke:mah.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="700.819" endTime="704.78">
<Sync time="700.819"/>
A:konimeh *más** name:chpale:wia:yah.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="704.78" endTime="733.358">
<Sync time="704.78"/>
Ka:n a:kah, tehwa:n sah *mismo** timopale:wia:yah, nokni:wa:n sah, 
<Sync time="708.876"/>
katka o:men ta:kameh tein tayeka:nayah, ke:mah.
<Sync time="715.167"/>
Wa:n nehwa ya wa:n ompa se: nokni:w, pos yeh okachi pili katka ok.
<Sync time="721.245"/>
Wa:n yehwa no:má:n te:chtixilia ya
<Sync time="725.867"/>
wa:n 'tapa:tskah ya, no:pá:n yeh kitatokilia ya ne:n nekkwa:t.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="733.358" endTime="738.926">
<Sync time="733.358"/>
Wa:n mokni:wa:n ta:kameh, tikihtowa wehwein, toni kichi:wayah.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="738.926" endTime="750.95">
<Sync time="738.926"/>
Pos yehwa:n tapa:tskah trapi:chehtsi:ntan wa:n yehwa:n owatekih, yehwa:n kowtehtekih, nochi kichi:wayah
<Sync time="745.961"/>
para mochi:waya ne:n *panela**.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="750.95" endTime="758.258">
<Sync time="750.95"/>
Ta:ka:n teisá: tikelka:w kwali 'te:chtapowi:s ok.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="758.258" endTime="766.911">
<Sync time="758.258"/>
Pos no..., nochi a kit tein, tein ti..., titapa:tskayah iwki a ke:meh nikihtohtok.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="766.911" endTime="772.298">
<Sync time="766.911"/>
Komohkó:n a:mo teh tikelna:miki ok kwali 'te:chili:s moto:ka:y.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="772.298" endTime="778.899">
<Sync time="772.298"/>
A:mo ta: name:chili:ti ok se: tein tieto:kayah ya.
<Sync time="776.945"/>
¿No: kwali name:chili:s?
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="778.899" endTime="780.216">
<Sync time="778.899"/>
*Este** sa:te:pan.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="780.216" endTime="788.7">
<Sync time="780.216"/>
Sa:te:pan, a: we:noh. Entó:s mah nimitsilia, pos ke:meh name:chilih Eugenia Samitez Lucas.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="788.7" endTime="791.291">
<Sync time="788.7"/>
Ka:nachi xiwit tikpia.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="791.291" endTime="796.469">
<Sync time="791.291"/>
Ne:, *setenta y tres**.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="796.469" endTime="798.772">
<Sync time="796.469"/>
Katí:n xola:l tiwa:le:wa.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="798.772" endTime="803.956">
